Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You just said that you spent a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}time alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}さっき一人で過ごす時間が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}長いって言ってたよね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah. And sometimes you got to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}do that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}うん
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}時には地元の仲間とでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:06.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}even with the people you come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:06.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}距離を置かなきゃいけないこともある
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Because I feel safe alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}一人の方が安全だと感じるからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:11.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I feel like me chilling with you might
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:11.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}be a liability for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:11.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}お前とつるむこと自体が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:11.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺にはリスクかもしれねぇ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:14.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Just because we just live two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:14.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}different lifestyles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:14.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}生き方が全然違うし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and I think differently from ground
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}up than you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}根本から考え方も違うから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:19.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}you might put me in harm's way and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:19.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}not even realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:19.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}知らないうちに俺を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:19.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}危険な目に遭わせるかもしれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So cut them people off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}じゃあそういう奴らとは縁を切ると
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:22.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}No, but that's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:22.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}いや、お前のことだって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:25.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It could be you. It could be you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:25.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Charlamagne, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:25.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}お前かもしれないし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:25.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}今ここにいるシャーラメインかもな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:26.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Charlamagne ain't gonna put you in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:26.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}a place
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:26.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}シャーラメインがお前を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:27.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}where you feel like your life is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:27.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}threatened. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:27.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}命の危険にさらすことはねぇよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:29.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Envy ain't gonna put you in a place
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:29.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}エンヴィーだって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}where you feel like your life is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}threatened. Intentionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}命の危険にさらしたりしねぇ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}わざとはな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:32.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}No, we got too much to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:32.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}しないしない、俺らも失うもんが多すぎる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I don't want to sound tough or none
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}イキってるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}聞こえたくはないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}but I'm dramatically different from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the average person. You feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺は普通の人とは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}全然違うんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's to a certain extent, the security
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}don't even got it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ある程度までいくと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}セキュリティでさえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}in him nine times out of ten. Like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}10回中9回は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}そこまでの覚悟ないからな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}What I'ma do? Like, I'ma put you to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺がどうするかって？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}お前を試すんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:47.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Go in the street and let me see you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:47.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}in extreme situation. You feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:47.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ストリートに出て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:47.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}極限状態のお前を見せてみろって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.57,0:00:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Sometimes you got to fight fire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.57,0:00:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.57,0:00:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}時には毒を以て毒を制す
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.57,0:00:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}しかねぇんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Sometimes I be around the bros and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I be like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}仲間といる時も
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:55.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}bro, y'all annoying me. You feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:55.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「お前らうぜぇよ」って言うしな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And they know that. They know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}We talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あいつらもわかってる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ちゃんと話してるし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I be like, I love y'all, bro. I want y'all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}to do better, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「愛してるよ、お前らには
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}もっとちゃんとしてほしいんだよ」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But y'all is annoying. Y'all in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}You feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「でもうぜぇし、邪魔なんだよ」って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But to a certain extent, you just kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}of like, you need to balance it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でもある程度は
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}バランス取らなきゃいけない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's just because I can't change. This
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}is like my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺は変われないからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}これが俺の人生なんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:10.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Like, this is like, you feel me? You
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:10.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}know, but this is how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:10.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}わかるだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:10.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}これが俺の気持ちなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:14.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You'll be singing a totally different
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:14.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}tune in five years. Guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:14.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}5年後には全然違うこと言ってるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:14.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}絶対な
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:15.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Hopefully so. You feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:15.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}だといいけどな
